  "history_of_present_illness": "The patient has a long-standing history of progressive chronic kidney disease documented since 1997, advancing from stage 1 to stage 4 by 2009. The renal decline is attributed to diabetic kidney disease, evidenced by proteinuria and microalbuminuria linked to type 2 diabetes mellitus. Hypertension, present since 1989, has been managed with a three\u2011drug regimen, suggesting resistant hypertension. Anemia developed in 2008, likely anemia of chronic kidney disease. Obesity (BMI \u226530) has been present since the 1980s, contributing to metabolic and cardiovascular risk. The patient is awaiting kidney transplantation since 2009. Psychosocial stressors, social isolation, limited contact, and a criminal record are noted, potentially affecting adherence and transplant eligibility. The most recent encounter was in early 2011, and no laboratory or vital sign data are available after that date.",
